# Phase 11 — Show Exact AI Context

For the Ollama stage provide expandable sections:

```text
SYSTEM PROMPT
USER PROMPT
RETRIEVED DATA
CONTEXT
FINAL PROMPT
RAW OLLAMA JSON
PARSED RESPONSE
```

This is critical because we need to determine whether the AI problem is:

```text
No data retrieved
        OR
Data retrieved but not passed to Ollama
        OR
Incorrect prompt
        OR
Ollama failure
        OR
Ollama hallucination
        OR
Response parser failure
        OR
Frontend rendering failure
```

